  "question": {
    "text": "Suppose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> is a polynomial of degree four having critical points at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.&nbsp;If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the sum of squares of all the elements of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math> is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Integrating both sides with respect to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Thus, sum of squares of all the elements of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>T</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>.</p>"
  }
}